f indices for pop 1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>inter_distance </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pop1_inds</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pop1_inds</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># rows are group 1, columns are group 2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>boxplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">total </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">`inter-population distance`</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inter_distance</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/zMAjheJ.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://i.imgur.com/zMAjheJ.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480709836000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0phOmxcuW7U4UH1hoq2GZS\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/9t25riL96QPkj9giaK4bTzhTUOi9q9s8SNqq0YwEX_Ko_RITm1qbOooDsdYG5Gc2bw=w5000-h5000\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"228\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Hope that&#39;s helpful.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p 